    dcterms:description "\"Relative Atomic Mass \" is a dimensionless physical quantity, the ratio of the average mass of atoms of an element (from a given source) to 1/12 of the mass of an atom of carbon-12 (known as the unified atomic mass unit)"^^rdf:HTML ;
