ns2:EnumerationKind-Aspect a ns2:Class,
        ns2:EnumerationKind-Aspect,
        sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "EnumerationKind Aspect" ;
    rdfs:comment """This class has enumerated subclasses usually used to specify the context of a s223:Property. The following table lists all of the defined enumerations for Aspect. \r
  Some Aspect enumerations have subclasses for more specific use. Those subclasses are not shown in the table but each of them are defined in `s223:Aspect-DayOfWeek` - `s223:Aspect-ElectricalVoltagePhases`. \r
  The following table lists all of the defined enumerations for Aspect.""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ns2:EnumerationKind .

